"1707.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1708.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from 'Abdullah ibn 'Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
