"1785.1","And Mālik narrated to me, from ‘Abdullāh ibn Dīnār, from ‘Abdullāh ibn ‘Umar, that the Messenger of Allāh, may Allāh bless him and grant him peace, said: \He who drags his garment out of arrogance"
"1785.2","‘Abdullāh ibn Dīnār reported from ‘Abdullāh ibn ‘Umar that he said: \I saw the Messenger of Allāh"
