"1801.1","And it was narrated to me from Malik, from Ibn Shihab, from Abu Bakr bin Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Umar, from Abdullah bin Umar, that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: \When one of you eats"
"1801.2","Malik narrated that it reached him that a slave girl belonging to Abdullah bin Umar bin Al-Khattab, whom Umar bin Al-Khattab saw, had prepared herself in the manner of free women. So he went to his daughter Hafsah and said: \Did I not see your brother's slave girl mingling with people"
"1802.1","And it was narrated to me from Malik, from Abu Az-Zinad, from Al-A'raj, from Abu Hurairah, that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: \The miskin is not the one who goes around to people"
"1802.2","From Abdullah bin Dinar, that Abdullah bin Umar said: \When we pledged allegiance to the Messenger of Allah"
